  "ruleText": "Plc 1502.22 “Registered pulmonary function technologist (RPFT)” means “registered pulmonary function technologist” as defined in RSA 326-E:1, IX, reprinted in Appendix C.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Plc 1500) #13496, INTERIM, eff 11-27-22; ss by #13621, eff 5-22-23 (formerly Plc 1502.18) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 1500)",
